        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d99771f-9c96-48ee-9d28-218c6a21778b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rCornelia Stuyvesant has grown tired of living in her father&apos;s shadow. \r\rWhile Marcus is busy elsewhere, she has begun building her own circle of loyal followers within the Ark Society. Unfortunately for her, ambition often attracts unwanted attention. Remove Cornelia and her accomplices before this little coup gains momentum. \r\rAnd remember, 47... sometimes people fall on their own. Sometimes things simply... fall on them.\r\rGood Luck.\r-Twiice",
